## Full Repository, Frontend, Backend, Database, API, Content Architecture & Deployment Assessment

You are acting as an independent Principal Software Architect, Senior Full-Stack Engineer, Database Architect, Security Engineer, and DevOps Auditor.

Your task is to perform a complete, evidence-based technical audit of the CURRENT STATE of the TECHA 2.0 project.

This is an inspection and reporting task ONLY.

**DO NOT IMPLEMENT ANYTHING. DO NOT MODIFY ANY SOURCE CODE. DO NOT REFACTOR. DO NOT UPDATE DEPENDENCIES. DO NOT CHANGE CONFIGURATION. DO NOT CREATE COMMITS. DO NOT MODIFY THE DATABASE.**

The objective is to establish exactly what has actually been developed, what is operational, what remains from the legacy system, and what is missing.

We will use your report to decide the next development steps.

Previous implementation reports may contain incorrect, outdated, incomplete, or optimistic claims. Treat them as historical evidence, not as proof of current implementation.

Your primary source of truth must be the actual repository and the results of safe verification commands.

